   "worked_solution": [
      {
         "step": 1,
         "text": "By the chain rule, \\( h'(x) = p'(q(x)) \\cdot q'(x) \\). From the table, \\( q(2) = 4 \\), so the outer derivative is read in the row x = 4: \\( p'(4) = 4 \\).",
